Canonical scientific Markdown/LaTeX PDF orchestration. The default route is
Markdown -> Pandoc AST/LaTeX -> XeLaTeX -> PDF. Chromium is available only as
an explicit diagnostic route.

positional arguments:
  source
  output

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --resource-dir RESOURCE_DIR
  --local-override LOCAL_OVERRIDE
  --profile PROFILE
  --route {auto,canonical-markdown,direct-xelatex,chromium-diagnostic,project-command}
  --project-command PROJECT_COMMAND
  --work-dir WORK_DIR
  --preview-dir PREVIEW_DIR
  --preview-pages PREVIEW_PAGES
                        'first', 'all', or a comma-separated list of one-based
                        pages.
  --receipt RECEIPT
